  "content": "<p><strong>下界深渊升级是一个小型模组，为下界的熔岩海增添了一些额外的动植物。它新增了九种鱼类、一个附魔和一种药水，方便玩家探索下界中的熔岩。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>依赖项</strong></p><p><strong>Geckolib 3.0</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>最新更新新增了一些鱼类和一种可在熔岩中视物的玻璃，让你能尽情打造熔岩水族箱 ;)</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UHJWXOX.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"374\" height=\"200\"><br></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>熔岩钓鱼</strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SF98U0S.png\" width=\"366\" height=\"177\"></p><p><strong>本模组新增了在熔岩中钓鱼的能力（主世界/下界）</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>新鱼类</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N6iiT9P.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"264\" height=\"135\"></p><p><strong>灵魂吸盘鱼</strong> 生成于灵魂沙谷，可用于制作可爱的靴子</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fae924H.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"195\"></p><p><strong>凋骨鱼</strong> 生成于灵魂沙谷</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Exudvdm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"162\"></p><p><strong>骨头鱼</strong> 生成于下界荒地</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oJeUZib.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"202\"></p><p><strong>炽热鳕鱼</strong> 生成于下界荒地</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hcreNrT.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"266\" height=\"117\"></p><p><strong>荧光鲷鱼</strong> 生成于绯红森林</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sAbvkG2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"143\"></p><p><strong>熔岩河豚</strong> 生成于诡异森林，熔岩河豚可用于酿造新药水</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ve2oOl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"180\"></p><p><strong>黑曜石鱼</strong> 生成于玄武岩三角洲</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WIV121c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"212\"></p><p><strong>岩浆立方鱼</strong> 生成于玄武岩三角洲</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/njPA4vm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"190\"></p><p><strong>烈焰鱼</strong> 生成于堡垒结构中</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>深渊中还生成可吸收熔岩的海绵，放入水中后会变干</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/jfTxh71.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"662\" height=\"454\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>深渊中还会生成产出优质矿石的通风口<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SW1k1tv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"665\" height=\"482\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><pre>如有建议、报告漏洞或想交流本模组，请加入下方的Discord服务器！</pre><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/az7B3Y6UPW\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处加入我们的Discord服务器</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/KB9kRYV.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
